Attribution for the data: Philipp Schweizer, raspberry.tips —
"Raspberry Pi Imager download statistics: time series (rpi-os-trends)".
The underlying percentages are published by Raspberry Pi Ltd at
https://rpi-imager-stats.raspberrypi.com/ ; points before May 2026 were
recovered from snapshots in the Internet Archive (web.archive.org).
CC BY 4.0 covers the compilation, cleaning and time series in this repository.

